[
  {
    "id": 47,
    "text": "Silence is not a void; it is a fertile ground where self-control takes root and blossoms into wisdom.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.594578",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.594578",
    "uid": "quote-000047"
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "text": "Self-control is not about suppressing emotion but channeling it like water—directing its flow toward purpose rather than chaos.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.612361",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.612361",
    "uid": "quote-000051"
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "text": "True power resides not in unleashing anger but in harnessing its energy to fuel acts of creation instead of destruction.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.632146",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.632146",
    "uid": "quote-000055"
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "text": "A disciplined mind does not fear silence; it seeks it as a refuge where true insight and transformation are born.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.649633",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.649633",
    "uid": "quote-000058"
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "text": "Control is not domination—it is the ability to pause, breathe, and respond thoughtfully rather than react blindly.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.673272",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.673272",
    "uid": "quote-000063"
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "text": "Self-control is the bridge between desire and fulfillment—a structure built plank by plank in the quiet of reflection.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.692283",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.692283",
    "uid": "quote-000067"
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "text": "Discipline is choosing silence over outburst, mastery over impulse, and growth over stagnation.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.714084",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.714084",
    "uid": "quote-000071"
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "text": "Silence sharpens focus, allowing you to see beyond distractions and align action with authentic purpose.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.740049",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.740049",
    "uid": "quote-000075"
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "text": "In the stillness of your own silence, the storm of anger loses its roar.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.752952",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.752952",
    "uid": "quote-000077"
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "text": "To master yourself, first master the art of saying nothing.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.787002",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.787002",
    "uid": "quote-000082"
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "text": "In the pause before the outburst, lies the seed of your greatest growth.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.806310",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.806310",
    "uid": "quote-000085"
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "text": "Silence is the canvas; self-control paints the masterpiece.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.828686",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.828686",
    "uid": "quote-000089"
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "text": "Self-control is the bridge between who you are and who you will become.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.871868",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.871868",
    "uid": "quote-000094"
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "text": "Discipline turns the noise of impulse into the music of purpose.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.905469",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.905469",
    "uid": "quote-000099"
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "text": "The quiet mind bends the bow of patience to strike at greatness.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.928163",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.928163",
    "uid": "quote-000103"
  },
  {
    "id": 109,
    "text": "You grow not when you speak your mind, but when you master it.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.966703",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.966703",
    "uid": "quote-000109"
  },
  {
    "id": 112,
    "text": "Self-control is the quiet architect of a peaceful life.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.989965",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.989965",
    "uid": "quote-000112"
  },
  {
    "id": 116,
    "text": "Master your reactions, and you master your destiny.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.020795",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.020795",
    "uid": "quote-000116"
  },
  {
    "id": 120,
    "text": "A calm mind is a sharpened blade; it cuts through chaos cleanly.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.047777",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.047777",
    "uid": "quote-000120"
  },
  {
    "id": 124,
    "text": "Reacting is instinct; choosing not to is mastery.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.074570",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.074570",
    "uid": "quote-000124"
  },
  {
    "id": 128,
    "text": "Your emotions don't define you; your choices in response do.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.111684",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.111684",
    "uid": "quote-000128"
  },
  {
    "id": 133,
    "text": "Peace is not given—it's built with the bricks of self-control.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.165920",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.165920",
    "uid": "quote-000133"
  },
  {
    "id": 137,
    "text": "The most dangerous weapon is an untamed mind.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.204839",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.204839",
    "uid": "quote-000137"
  },
  {
    "id": 139,
    "text": "Control isn’t about suppression, it’s about direction.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.223219",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.223219",
    "uid": "quote-000139"
  },
  {
    "id": 144,
    "text": "Patience is the armor that protects progress from impulse.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.265956",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.265956",
    "uid": "quote-000144"
  },
  {
    "id": 145,
    "text": "Restraint is the true rebellion in a world that glorifies reaction.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.274625",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.274625",
    "uid": "quote-000145"
  },
  {
    "id": 149,
    "text": "Self-control is choosing your response, not reacting to your impulses.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.312922",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.312922",
    "uid": "quote-000149"
  },
  {
    "id": 153,
    "text": "Discipline is the bridge between dreams and reality—walk it daily.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.355066",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.355066",
    "uid": "quote-000153"
  },
  {
    "id": 157,
    "text": "The greatest power is not in domination, but in mastering yourself.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.389869",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.389869",
    "uid": "quote-000157"
  },
  {
    "id": 161,
    "text": "Control your thoughts, and you control your destiny.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.430177",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.430177",
    "uid": "quote-000161"
  },
  {
    "id": 165,
    "text": "Discipline is choosing what you want most over what you want now.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.470374",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.470374",
    "uid": "quote-000165"
  },
  {
    "id": 169,
    "text": "Self-mastery is the highest form of power.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.511323",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.511323",
    "uid": "quote-000169"
  },
  {
    "id": 173,
    "text": "خود پر کنٹرول ہی اصل طاقت ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.553831",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.553831",
    "uid": "quote-000173"
  },
  {
    "id": 177,
    "text": "ضبط ہی کامیابی کی کنجی ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Self-Discipline",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "royal",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 35.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.594921",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-06T05:54:35.373675",
    "uid": "quote-000177"
  }
]
